  "description": "MCP server bridging stdio to the Architecture Visualization Convex backend. CLI subcommands (scan-imports / scan-orphans / scan-drift) keep the canvas strictly in sync with code. v0.3.0 added dependency / navigation / data-flow edge inference plus link_nodes / unlink_nodes; v0.4.0 adds lookup_files for post-commit unlinked-file suggestions.",
